{"unit_id":"xsuas__dsh-balance-display#card-zh","repo":"xsuas/dsh-balance-display","commit":"38fc7fea80962725f5ed5fbce8a55c6155389f82","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-balance-display 是 DSH Web 插件，在输入栏左侧显示 DeepSeek API 账户余额。主机端通过 credentials 解析 DEEPSEEK_API_KEY，提供仅供回环地址访问的 /api/balance 路由，并向 DeepSeek 余额接口发起带超时的请求。结果在主机缓存 10 分钟，界面支持点击或键盘手动刷新、定时刷新，并在请求失败时保留旧余额作为过期状态。适合希望在 DSH Web 中快速查看账户余额的 DeepSeek 用户；需要配置 DeepSeek API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:6-9","lib/index.js:18-58","lib/index.js:65-107","lib/client.js:20-49","lib/client.js:55-120","cordis.patch.yml:1-3"]}
